main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ member template-id after non-dependent class-template-id \(true case\): SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ member template-id after non-dependent class-template-id \(false case\): SUCCESS$
